    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__779" type="place">Brooklyn</rs>, <date when="1946-01-30">Jan.
                        30th 46</date><lb/>62 Willow Str.<lb/>Main 4 3481</dateline><salute>Dear <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Prof.
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Some weeks ago I sent you a letter from <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3356"
                        type="person">Walther Schindler</rs>,<note type="ea">Liegt nicht vor.</note>
                    <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__37" type="place">Berlin</rs>, and hope you have
                    received it. I wonder whether you still need it for any purpose you have in
                    mind. If not, would you be good enough to return it to me?</p>
                <closer><salute>With best regards</salute><signed>sincerely yours <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__3354" type="person">Gertrud
                        Müller-Munk</rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
